EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Nothing's changed since I was a kid.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
We all still get silly when it snows!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Çocukluğumdan beri hiçbir şey değişmedi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kar yağınca hâlâ hepimiz saçmalıyoruz!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}You know how, on snowy days, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
there are those moments when
everything goes completely silent?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's super weird!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Quand il neige,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} t'as déjà fait
l'expérience d'un de ces moments
où on entendrait une mouche voler ?{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Quoi ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} T'as jamais entendu de
mouche voler l'hiver ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Pfff...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}, va !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Hai notato anche tu che certe volte,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
quando nevica, diventa tutto
improvvisamente silenzioso?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Che cosa strana,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Wenn es schneit, ist's immer so still!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Als wär alles in Watte eingepackt! {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Äh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} was laber ich da eigentlich?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Karlı günlerde bazen{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} her yerin bir anda
tamamen sessizleştiği anlar olur ya?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Acayip tuhaf!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
